{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50101","headline":"夕阳洞 · 无名氏","name":"夕阳洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顺山高几许，亭亭似人蹲。\n左右自回抱，抱中有清源。\n异石匝阶墀，巉巉快四轩。\n凭几见城邑，一峯当石门。\n自从得兹洞，爱之忘朝昏。\n吾欲老於此，便爲海阳人。\n谁爲高世者，与我能修邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}